{"id":59,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"سَبَّحَ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۖ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَخْرَجَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِنْ أَهْلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رِهِمْ لِأَوَّلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَشْرِ‌ۚ مَا ظَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َخْرُجُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۖ</span> وَظَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّانِعَتُهُمْ حُصُونُه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ فَأَتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَمْ يَحْتَسِبُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۖ</span> وَقَذَفَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رُّعْبَ‌ۚ يُخْرِبُونَ بُيُوتَه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِأَيْدِيهِمْ وَأَيْدِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنِينَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>عْتَبِرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَلَوْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َتَبَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلَيْهِمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ لَعَذَّبَهُمْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا‌ۖ وَلَهُمْ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ عَذَابُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ بِأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُمْ ش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓقُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>‌ۖ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>ُش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓقِّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ شَدِيدُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"مَا قَطَعْت<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ل</span>ِّينَةٍ أَوْ تَرَكْتُمُوهَا ق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِمَةً عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أُصُولِهَا فَبِإِذْنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَلِيُخْزِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>سِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مِنْهُمْ فَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَوْجَفْتُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ خَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ و</span>َلَا رِكَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ و</span>َلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يُسَلِّطُ رُسُلَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَىٰ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ق</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"مّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مِنْ أَهْلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرَىٰ فَلِلَّهِ وَلِلرَّسُولِ وَلِذِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْبَىٰ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مَىٰ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَسَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِينِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>نِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّبِيلِ كَىْ لَا يَ